5,1,1,talk,Mio,,"Hi everyone! I'm so excited for this year's camp! To get us started, I'd like to look into the group transport receipts and the quoting terms for whole-building lets. What about you all?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"It is lovely to see everyone so enthusiastic. I believe it is important that we all bond well, so I will look into what the seniors say about year-groups mixing and the attendance sheets for away camps.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I want to ensure the workload is manageable for the organizers this time. I'll look into the canteen closure and last year's cooking duty, as well as the lottery and application for public group bookings.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to make sure everyone actually gets some sleep this year! I'll look into the accounts from two clubs that went inland and the vacation timetable for the club's own hall.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I'll look into the prefecture rate sheet for publicly run beds and the membership list against first-train times. I want to get a clearer picture of the actual costs involved.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"Since we've all picked our topics, I'm curious if anyone else is worried about the budget or how we handle cancellations? I feel like those are things we should keep in mind while we research.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"That is a very thoughtful point, Mio. I also wonder if we should consider how the environment affects our spirits. A place where we can truly relax together might be just as important as the budget.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, budget is important, but we must also consider the administrative burden. If the booking process is too grueling, it puts an unfair strain on the organizers. We need a sustainable system for everyone involved.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,"I agree with Ryuji! But we also can't forget that if we're too tired to move, we can't train properly. I hope the places we're looking at have comfy beds and a good schedule!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"I agree that we need to balance the workload and the comfort. However, we must be precise with the numbers this time to avoid any unexpected gaps in the club's budget.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,"I totally agree, Misaki! Precision is key. I'm hoping the transport receipts will show us where the biggest costs are so we can plan better. Does anyone else think we should prioritize a location that's easier to get to?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"Easier travel would certainly be a kindness to those who struggle with long journeys. However, I wonder if a bit of distance might actually encourage the members to step out of their usual circles and bond more deeply.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shizue, while bonding is valuable, we shouldn't sacrifice efficiency for it. If the travel is too taxing or the booking is too complex, the organizers will be exhausted before the camp even begins.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,"I think we should find a place that's fun but not too far! If the travel is too long, we'll be sleepy before we even start training. Let's see what the research tells us!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"Let's wait for the results. Once we have the data on rates and transport, we can determine a realistic budget that doesn't rely on guesswork. That will be the most reliable way to decide the location.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mio,,Sounds like a plan! I'm really looking forward to seeing what we find. Let's all do our best with the research so we can pick the perfect spot for everyone!,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,1,4,pass,Mio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I agree. Let us all reflect on our findings with a kind heart and an open mind. I look forward to hearing what you all discover.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,1,4,pass,Shizue,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I agree. Let's focus on the facts once the information is available. I'll be interested to see if the administrative requirements for the public facilities are as demanding as I suspect.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,1,4,pass,Ryuji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,1,4,talk,Rin,,"I'm ready too! I hope we find a place where everyone can sleep soundly and wake up full of energy for training. I can't wait to see the results!

Rin:","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,1,4,pass,Rin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,1,4,talk,Misaki,,"I agree. Let's proceed with the research and see what the data reveals. I'll be waiting for the results.

Misaki:","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
