64,3,1,talk,Mio,,"Everything points to the Coastal Lodge! It solves the cooking and scheduling issues, and as long as we're strict about the cancellation fees, it's the best choice. I vote for Option C!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"I agree. The Coastal Lodge will allow our members to stay together and truly bond, which is so important for the club's harmony. I also vote for Option C.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,Option C is the only logical choice. It eliminates the excessive administrative burden of the public centers and the labor-intensive cooking duties of the campus option. I vote for Option C.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,1,talk,Rin,,I'm with everyone! No weird schedules or crowded rooms for me. I want a place where we can all relax and wake up happy. I vote for Option C!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"I agree. Option C is the most practical choice, provided we implement a strict payment policy to protect the club's budget from cancellation gaps. I vote for Option C.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Mio,,"Since we've all voted for Option C, it looks like we're all in agreement! I'm so glad we could find a solution that works for everyone.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
