71,3,2,talk,Shizue,,It is a relief that we have reached such a warm consensus. I am certain that the Coastal Lodge will bring us all closer together.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
72,3,2,pass,Shizue,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
73,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,The decision is unanimous and based on a rational assessment of the available data. We have successfully avoided the pitfalls of the other two options.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
74,3,2,pass,Ryuji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
75,3,2,talk,Rin,,I'm so happy! We're going to the beach! I can't wait to see everyone actually getting some sleep and having a great time.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
76,3,2,pass,Rin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
77,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"I am glad we reached a consensus. I will make sure the payment terms are clearly documented so the budget remains stable. I'm looking forward to a successful camp.

